    "text": "5.(1) It shall be lawful for the Corporation, at anyGeneral Meeting and by a majority of not less thantwo-thirds of the members present and voting to make rulesfrom time to time, not inconsistence with the provisions ofthis Act, or any other written law, for all or any of thefollowing matters:\u2014",
