  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      340.61,
      401.9,
      409.43
    ],
    "text": "7.All debts and liabilities of the Foundation existingon the day immediately preceding the date of commencementof this Act, shall be paid and discharged by the Corporationand all debts due to, and subscriptions and contributionspayable to the Foundation on that day shall be paid to theCorporation for the purpose of this Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      421.13,
      401.89,
      455.39
    ],
    "text": "8.(1) The Corporation shall cause proper accounts tobe kept of income and expenditure, assets and liabilitiesand all other transactions of the Corporation.",
    "fonts": [
