    "text": "10.The seal of the Corporation shall not be affixed toany instrument whatsoever except in the presence of theSecretary, the Chairman and the Treasurer who shall signtheir names on the instrument in token of their presence andsuch signing shall be independent of the signing of anyperson as a witness.",
